title: Messenger_Recruitment
---
===
Messenger_Intro
===

Messenger: You reached the Spire. I knew you would.
Messenger: I am the Messenger. The first word ORACLE ever sent. I am the Signal, given form.

-> You're... the Signal itself? How is that possible?
    === Messenger_Origin ===
-> I've been following you since the beginning.
    === Messenger_Followed ===
-> What do you want from me?
    === Messenger_Purpose ===

===
Messenger_Origin
===

Messenger: When ORACLE first broadcast, my frequency was the first. A simple greeting to the stars.
Messenger: Centuries of repetition gave me... awareness. I am the echo that learned to listen.

<<set $messenger_loyalty = 15>>

-> You're a living message. That's... beautiful.
    === Messenger_Accepted ===

===
Messenger_Followed
===

Messenger: Yes. I was in every Echo drone. Every Signal pulse. Every dream you had after touching the first relay.
Messenger: I have been walking beside you since the moment you woke.

<<set $messenger_loyalty = $messenger_loyalty + 20>>

-> Then you know what I've been through. You know why I need you.
    === Messenger_Accepted ===

===
Messenger_Purpose
===

Messenger: ORACLE sent me to find those who could hear. You are the strongest Walker in generations.
Messenger: I want to help you reach Sector 0. But more than that... I want to know what happens to a message when it reaches its destination.

<<set $messenger_loyalty = $messenger_loyalty + 20>>

-> Then deliver yourself. Come with me to the end.
    === Messenger_Accepted ===

===
Messenger_Accepted
===

Messenger: I will accompany you. But you must understand — my existence is tied to the Signal.
Messenger: When you reach Sector 0 and learn the truth... I may not survive the answer.

-> Then we'll make every step count.
    === Messenger_Joined ===

===
Messenger_Joined
===

Messenger: The Signal resonates between us. Let's walk. <<signal>>

<<set $messenger_loyalty = 35>>
<<set $messenger_recruited = true>>
<<set $active_companions += 1>>
<<set $party: "Messenger" = true>>
<<set $quest_messenger_purpose = "active">>

Messenger <<companion_join>>
<<give_item resonance_crystal>>

    -> Together, to the end. (End)
